# Data and run artifacts. Leading slash matters: an unanchored `data/` also
# matches the package module coarsecl/data/, which silently kept the dataset and
# task-stream code out of every commit.
/data/
/checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth

# results/ IS tracked: each run dir is a resolved config + metrics.json +
# acc_matrix.csv, a few KB of text, and the accuracy matrices are the record of
# what every condition actually did. Keep binaries and checkpoints out of it.

